--- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $A$ | $=$ | $\\int $ | {{field-2}} | $\\text{d}x$ |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |  |" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385795 1113 #uuid "7149286b-e549-5d38-a39f-76c05cf90c8a" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385795 1145 "We want to express the area $A$ between the function $f(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}+1$ and the $x$-axis, between $x=-3$ and $x=2.$\n\nThis can be expressed as the definite integral of $f(x)=\\sqrt{x+4}+1$ between the lower limit $x=-3$ and the upper limit $x=2,$ as follows:\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-3}^{2}\\sqrt{x+4}+1\\,\\text{d}x\n$$" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385796 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385797 13194139536142 true] [17592186385796 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536142 true] [17592186385796 1041 "field-1" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385796 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385797 13194139536142 true] [17592186385796 1110 #uuid "29450bb5-2f5e-5296-9d47-cdefdbb1cbf7" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385797 1034 "2" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385797 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536142 true] [17592186385797 1111 #uuid "83376cd6-9412-5702-a19a-8908538dbb62" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385799 13194139536142 true] [17592186385798 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536142 true] [17592186385798 1041 "field-2" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385798 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385799 13194139536142 true] [17592186385798 1110 #uuid "b47ad40b-156b-50b6-921e-6b7eddbf465e" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385799 1034 "\\sqrt{x+4}+1" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385799 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536142 true] [17592186385799 1111 #uuid "07043285-b7be-5a87-80c3-0554ac463280" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385800 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385801 13194139536142 true] [17592186385800 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536142 true] [17592186385800 1041 "field-3" 13194139536142 true] [17592186385800 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385801 13194139536142 true] [17592186385800 1110 #uuid "35c2d09c-04f7-58bd-9223-0960d06493a4" 13194139536142